jbovlaste is a dictionary editing interface by ((Jay Kominek)), massively updated by ((Robin Lee Powell)), now in full production.

[http://www.lojban.org/jbovlaste/]


Brammo also created a program to create a dict database out of a database generated by jbovlaste, {ATTACH(name=>lojtexdict.tar.gz,inline=1)}lojtexdict{ATTACH}.